  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kolkata Girls: Anti-trafficking / Pro-Empowerment.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our safe house has been operating since 2012. We have 16 girls receiving 24/7 care. They come from one of the very biggest source sex-trafficking districts in India - Murshidabad, West Bengal. We have just accepted a further 6 girls which has meant that we have had to rearrange our whole budget! Because of the poverty from which they have come, we are working hard to offer quality food. Hence we are seeking support specifically for nutritious/clean food for our girls for a full 12-month period.</narrative>
  </description>
